---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Editorial standards and privacy — KRISM" description="How KRISM prepares, reviews and protects website information.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Transparency" icon="shield" title="Editorial standards and privacy." description="Clear boundaries for health information, external resources, corrections and personal data." />
  <section class="surface-mineral"><div class="page-wrap grid gap-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:py-24">
    <article class="content-card p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-medium">Educational scope</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-8 text-krism-muted">Public sleep-health material is general education, not individual medical advice. It must not diagnose, prescribe treatment or discourage professional care.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-medium">Review and freshness</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-8 text-krism-muted">Managed content has draft, review, published and archived states. Bilingual publication is tracked separately. Health material should show a review date and named reviewer when formal clinical review has occurred.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-medium">Sources and corrections</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-8 text-krism-muted">External material is labeled with its source and does not imply endorsement or affiliation. Correction requests can be sent through the contact page and should identify the page and supporting source.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-medium">Privacy</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-8 text-krism-muted">Sleep Check answers remain in the browser and are not transmitted or stored. The contact form opens the visitor’s email application; the website does not retain the message. Essential secure cookies are used only for authenticated administrators.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card p-8 lg:col-span-2"><h2 class="text-2xl font-medium">Safety</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-8 text-krism-muted">The website is not an emergency service. People with urgent symptoms or an immediate safety concern should stop using the educational tools and contact appropriate local emergency or urgent-care services.</p><p class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold text-krism-muted">Policy version 1.0 · Updated 4 October 2026</p></article>
  </div></section>
</MainLayout>
